      "caveats": [
        "THE BASIS CHANGES IN 2020. Years to 2019 are the FBI's Summary Reporting System, which was then retired; 2020 onward are NIBRS-based national estimates built from agencies covering 87.2% of the population in 2024. The chart breaks the line there rather than drawing through it, and the index across the break is not a single measurement.",
        "Fewer burglaries are reported to police than a decade ago \u2014 40.7% of victimisations in 2024 against 58.8% in 2010. Some of this police-recorded fall is fewer break-ins and some is fewer reports, and the two cannot be separated.",
